 "shownotes": [
  "During the Blaze On jam, Trey addressed the crowd: the storm wasn't passing through, the show would end early, and the band would skip the encore to maximize playing time.",
  "Community pulse — rated 2.92/5 on Phish.net the night of the show. Nearly everyone points to Ghost as the peak — a jam soundtracked by actual thunder and lightning over the lawn. The frustration is with what the weather stole: a second set building momentum, cut off mid-flight."
 ],
