      "name": "Banter",
      "notes": "Trey announces early end to show due to weather",
      "transcript": "TREY: Hey everybody, I'm gonna tell you something right while we're playing here. Very strange thing just happened in my ears, which I was told that we have to stop at a certain time - it's not yet - but it's earlier than we normally stop, so we're not gonna do an encore or anything, we're just gonna go right until they stop us, but uh, 'cuz of the weather, unfortunately, the storm is not passing through, so we're gonna play until they stop us, but trust me, it's not us stopping, it's them telling us we have to stop. Thanks for understanding."
     }
